- Gloo (Tank): +3.7 pp edge. Gloo's durability and kit give them a strong matchup advantage against Jawhead throughout the game.
- Esmeralda (Tank/Mage): +2.9 pp edge. Esmeralda's durability and kit give them a strong matchup advantage against Jawhead throughout the game.
- Lolita (Support/Tank): +2.6 pp edge. Lolita's durability and kit give them a strong matchup advantage against Jawhead throughout the game.
- Popol and Kupa (Marksman): +2.5 pp edge. Popol and Kupa has a statistical edge over Jawhead based on ranked matchup data. Pick Popol and Kupa to gain an advantage in draft.

