## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Conceal Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Rapid Boots, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when chain control or slows stop Jawhead from finishing the Ejector throw after entering vision.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn damage where stacked Magic Defense outvalues one burst shield window.; Guardian Helmet over Oracle when Use when Jawhead keeps surviving first contact but has to reset HP before the next bush rotation.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the enemy marksman is the main follow-up threat and must hit Jawhead after the fling lands.
- Total cost: 11060 gold

Default roam setup for hidden Ejector angles, faster Flicker cycles, and enough shield value to live after delivering the target.

### EXP Burst Bruiser (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, War Axe, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, War Axe
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use against physical EXP and jungle pressure when crowd-control reduction is not deciding the all-in.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use before armor stacking when a healer, shield support, or high-HP fighter keeps surviving the burst window.; Queen's Wings over Immortality when Use when fights are extended and the low-HP damage reduction plus cooldown refund keeps Ejector online.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use only when ahead and your team already has enough front line to let Jawhead commit as a finisher.
- Total cost: 10940 gold

Side-lane burst setup for punishing isolated carries after Ejector, while War Axe and Hunter Strike keep Jawhead moving through skirmishes.

### Jungle Tempo Pickoff (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Malefic Roar over Blade of Despair when Use once enemy frontliners stack armor and Jawhead has to finish targets through physical defense instead of raw attack.; Sky Piercer over War Axe when Use only in snowball games where early kills are realistic and death risk is low enough to protect stacks.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when sustain or shields are the reason Ejector targets survive after the first missile cycle.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield lets Jawhead survive entry without waiting for a revive.
- Total cost: 11890 gold

Jungle variant for early invades and single-target picks, using Ice Retribution and Hunter Strike speed to stay glued to the thrown target.

